# Source of truth

Edit `packages/*/src` and `playground`. Do not edit `dist`, `.nuxt`, `.output`, or `public/uploads`.

Client code imports `@katecms/core` through `packages/core/src/browser.ts`. Server code, tests, and `module.ts` import `packages/core/src/index.ts`. Do not import the database, sharp, kysely, or password hashing into Vue or other client files.

`nuxtcms-module` (`/api/_cms`, `src/runtime/components`) is an older tree. Do not copy from it or change it while working on KateCMS.

Admin UI copy is English.
